WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,950
As long as the great white shark has enough charging speed to hit it,

2
00:00:15,950 --> 00:00:18,150
A steel pole can skewer his poisonous effects

3
00:00:18,150 --> 00:00:47,450
What is recovered is only the last position of the lifeboat.

4
00:00:47,450 --> 00:00:49,450
Miss Shen fell into the water here

5
00:00:49,450 --> 00:00:51,450
But it's been so long now

6
00:00:51,450 --> 00:00:53,450
The current and wind direction will take people away

7
00:00:53,450 --> 00:00:58,195
Even the tide

8
00:00:58,195 --> 00:01:00,567
wind direction

9
00:01:00,567 --> 00:01:02,940
ocean current

10
00:01:02,940 --> 00:01:07,620
Calculate for me all the possible places he can drift to.
